WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.836
♪♪

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.438
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:08.842
The CDC announced last week
that fully vaccinated Americans

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.343
no longer need to wear masks

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.311
in most indoor
or outdoor settings.

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:16.649
"Oh, my God, finally!",
said unvaccinated Americans.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:18.651
After the CDC
announced it on Thursday

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:22.655
that vaccinated people no longer
need to wear face masks indoors,

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:25.124
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
said that masks

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:27.493
will still be required
in the chamber.

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.462
And when Marjorie Taylor Greene
heard that,

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:33.232
she became so unhinged
that nobody noticed

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:36.502
any change in
her demeanor whatsoever.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:37.736
According to
The New York Times,

00:00:37.736 --> 00:00:40.106
President Biden
does not make quick decisions

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:43.242
and often asks for
detailed briefings and debates

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:45.211
from staffers
before making up his mind,

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.648
which is honestly refreshing,
considering the last guy

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:52.251
didn't always get
the wrapper off the burger.

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:53.485
According to a new poll,

00:00:53.485 --> 00:00:56.956
only 52% of Americans
say they trust the CDC.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:01:01.027
Reached for comment,
the CDC said, "Ask again later."

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:02.895
According to a new report
in The New York Times,

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:05.565
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
is a wine connoisseur.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:07.801
Dr. Biden first
became interested in wine

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:11.170
the 38th time
she heard about Scranton.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.040
"I'm just going to
top this off."

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.642
According to a new survey,
72% of Americans

00:01:16.642 --> 00:01:19.512
think they could beat a rat
in a fight.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.847
9% think they could beat
a crocodile.

00:01:21.847 --> 00:01:25.017
And 6% think they could beat
a grizzly bear.

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:26.619
This news first reported

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.488
by the kid
you're trying to get to bed.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:31.858
"I don't know.
Uh, I guess rat, yes.

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.260
Crocodile, maybe."

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:37.096
Researchers in Japan
recently found that mammals

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:39.299
that have been deprived
of air can be saved

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:42.568
by receiving oxygen
through their anuses.

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:44.704
While researchers deprived
of oxygen

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:48.007
come up with
some pretty wild stuff.

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:51.343
A 111-year-old man in Australia,
who is believed to be

00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:54.414
the country's oldest-ever man,
said in a recent interview

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:58.151
that the secret to living a long
life is eating chicken brains.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:03.656
Oh, I didn't even know you could
get Hot Pockets in Australia.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.725
And, finally,
today was National Walnut Day.

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:09.262
Celebrate by ruining
some chocolate chip cookies.

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:10.830
♪♪

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.299
President Biden traveled
to Detroit today,

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:15.802
but only because someone
asked him about Israel.

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:17.470
[ As Biden ]
Whoops, I gotta go!

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.438
[ Laughter ]
President Biden spoke yesterday

00:02:19.438 --> 00:02:21.641
with Israeli Prime Minister
Benjamin Netanyahu

00:02:21.641 --> 00:02:23.643
and called for a cease-fire

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.678
in the fight between Israel
and Hamas.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.847
Oh, good,
if anyone can solve this,

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:31.317
it's definitely the guy
who can't control his own dog.

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:34.119
[ Laughter ]
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy said today

00:02:34.119 --> 00:02:37.089
he is opposed
to a 9/11-style commission

00:02:37.089 --> 00:02:40.058
to investigate
the January 6th Capitol attack.

00:02:40.058 --> 00:02:41.360
And, in similar news,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:44.197
Derek doesn't want you
to look in his sock drawer,

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:46.866
especially way in the back.

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:48.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:51.070
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo
announced yesterday

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.173
that the state will lift
its social distancing mandates

00:02:54.173 --> 00:02:56.509
this week
for fully vaccinated people.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:58.611
Okay, but, you know that's not

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:01.680
why people are staying
away from you, right?

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.216
[ Laughter ]
Former New York Mayor
Rudy Giuliani's son

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:08.120
Andrew Giuliani announced his
run for New York governor today

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.323
and told reporters,
"It's in my DNA."

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:13.125
Also sharing Rudy's DNA --

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:14.494
his first wife.

00:03:14.494 --> 00:03:20.466
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:22.935
Former Trump administration
official Stephen Miller

00:03:22.935 --> 00:03:24.670
has been accused
of trying to sabotage

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.273
New York mayoral candidate
Andrew Yang's campaign

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.908
by publicly endorsing him
in a series of tweets.

00:03:29.908 --> 00:03:33.646
And Yang can sabotage
his own campaign with tweets,

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:35.515
thank you very much.

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:38.084
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo
yesterday released

00:03:38.084 --> 00:03:40.853
his 2020 tax returns,
though, keep in mind,

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:43.356
he loves to underreport things.

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:46.058
[ Laughter ]
South Carolina
Governor Henry McMaster

00:03:46.058 --> 00:03:49.728
signed a bill into law yesterday
that requires death row inmates

00:03:49.728 --> 00:03:53.799
to choose between the electric
chair or a firing squad.

00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:55.601
Or there's always
the third option --

00:03:55.601 --> 00:03:57.270
just pay the parking ticket.

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.704
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.704 --> 00:04:01.840
A Tesla car on autopilot
recently crashed

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:05.244
into a Washington State
deputy sheriff's patrol vehicle

00:04:05.244 --> 00:04:06.812
and, now, the Tesla driver

00:04:06.812 --> 00:04:09.182
[ As Johnny Carson ]
will likely face
a battery charge.

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:12.051
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:14.253
Did you like that one, Wally,
"a battery charge"?

00:04:14.253 --> 00:04:20.126
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:22.495
And, finally,
an anonymous resident

00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:26.165
of an apartment in Australia
recently posted a message

00:04:26.165 --> 00:04:27.866
in the building's elevator,

00:04:27.866 --> 00:04:31.470
addressed "To the woman
[with] extremely loud orgasms."

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.839
[ Laughter ]
Can you imagine reading that
and thinking,

00:04:33.839 --> 00:04:35.641
"Oh, no!

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:37.543
I sound like a woman?!"?

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:39.278
♪♪

00:04:39.278 --> 00:04:41.748
President Biden today delivered
the commencement address

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:43.349
at the U.S. Coast Guard Academy.

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:46.419
The Coast Guard has changed
a lot since Biden was young,

00:04:46.419 --> 00:04:49.622
but then again,
so have the coasts.

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.690
After House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:54.426
came out in opposition yesterday
to a bipartisan agreement

00:04:54.426 --> 00:04:56.261
to create
a 9/11-style commission

00:04:56.261 --> 00:04:58.864
to investigate the January 6th
Capitol attack,

00:04:58.864 --> 00:05:01.234
Democratic Caucus Chair
Hakeem Jeffries said,

00:05:01.234 --> 00:05:04.436
"I don't know what
Kevin McCarthy is afraid of."

00:05:04.436 --> 00:05:07.740
Oh, if I was going to guess,
I'd say ghosts, spiders, clowns,

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:10.109
lightning, dogs,
spicy food, fireworks,

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:11.511
and Donald Trump?

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:13.579
The House voted today
on legislation

00:05:13.579 --> 00:05:15.480
to create
an independent commission

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.016
tasked with investigating

00:05:17.016 --> 00:05:19.752
the January 6th attack
on the Capitol,

00:05:19.752 --> 00:05:21.920
while House Republicans
are still claiming

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:25.457
that there was no January 6th
this year.

00:05:25.457 --> 00:05:29.361
President Biden yesterday toured
Ford's electric vehicle facility

00:05:29.361 --> 00:05:30.763
in advance of the company today

00:05:30.763 --> 00:05:32.831
unveiling its new truck,
the Lightning.

00:05:32.831 --> 00:05:35.835 line:0%
So just try peeing on this one,
Calvin.

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:40.272
Several Republican lawmakers
on Tuesday

00:05:40.272 --> 00:05:43.309
protested House Speaker
Nancy Pelosi's mask rules

00:05:43.309 --> 00:05:45.677
on the floor
during a voting session.

00:05:45.677 --> 00:05:47.746
And Representative Bryan Mast
said after

00:05:47.746 --> 00:05:51.751
that the fine was the,
"best $500 I ever spent."

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:52.919
"Not me,"

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:54.453
said Matt Gaetz.

00:05:54.453 --> 00:05:56.522
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.522 --> 00:05:59.726
"I got the Venmo receipt
to prove it."

00:05:59.726 --> 00:06:02.327
The New York Attorney General's
Office announced yesterday

00:06:02.327 --> 00:06:04.197
they are,
"actively investigating

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:06.698
the Trump Organization
in a criminal capacity."

00:06:06.698 --> 00:06:07.766
"That's awful,"

00:06:07.766 --> 00:06:11.403
said Ivanka...Jones.

00:06:11.403 --> 00:06:13.105
A strip club in Las Vegas

00:06:13.105 --> 00:06:16.409
will begin offering coronavirus
vaccinations later this week.

00:06:16.409 --> 00:06:19.044
They'll have Moderna
and AstraZeneca,

00:06:19.044 --> 00:06:21.914
but just know their real names
are Cynthia and Beth.

00:06:21.914 --> 00:06:24.383
[ Laughter ]

00:06:24.383 --> 00:06:25.851
A strip club in Las Vegas

00:06:25.851 --> 00:06:28.554
will begin offering coronavirus
vaccinations this week.

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:33.492
Said dudes, "Am I crazy, or did
that nurse really like me?"

00:06:33.492 --> 00:06:35.060
A strip club in Las Vegas

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:38.497
will begin offering coronavirus
vaccinations later this week.

00:06:38.497 --> 00:06:42.735
But just remember,
they can vax you,

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:46.205
but you can't vax them.

00:06:46.205 --> 00:06:48.507
The vacation rental company
booking.com

00:06:48.507 --> 00:06:51.176
will offer fans
of the sitcom "Friends"

00:06:51.176 --> 00:06:52.878
a chance to win
an overnight stay

00:06:52.878 --> 00:06:55.047
in a replica of Monica's
New York City apartment.

00:06:55.047 --> 00:06:57.416
So if you've always wanted
to spend the night

00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:01.854
at Monica's apartment,
just tell her, man.

00:07:01.854 --> 00:07:04.857
Mattel yesterday unveiled
a Helen Keller Barbie doll.

00:07:04.857 --> 00:07:07.059
Still not as blind as Barbie.

00:07:07.059 --> 00:07:09.694
How can you not see it?

00:07:09.694 --> 00:07:11.130
Do you really believe

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:14.333
those are business trips
he takes every weekend?

00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:16.201
And, finally,
a woman recently wrote

00:07:16.201 --> 00:07:20.038
to the "Dear Prudence" advice
column in Slate magazine,

00:07:20.038 --> 00:07:23.041
asking what to do about finding
her 12-year-old son

00:07:23.041 --> 00:07:25.644
in a compromising position
with the vacuum cleaner.

00:07:25.644 --> 00:07:27.579
Well, for starters,

00:07:27.579 --> 00:07:29.348
change the bag.

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:31.116
♪♪

00:07:31.116 --> 00:07:33.252
President Biden misspoke
earlier this week

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:36.121
during his visit to Michigan
and referred to his father,

00:07:36.121 --> 00:07:38.591
who was a salesperson,
as a coal miner.

00:07:38.591 --> 00:07:41.827
I'm sorry, but how the hell
do you mix those two up?

00:07:41.827 --> 00:07:44.329
That's like saying,
"And my mom was a homemaker --

00:07:44.329 --> 00:07:46.265
oh, wait, astronaut."

00:07:46.265 --> 00:07:49.134
The White House said yesterday
that President Biden spoke

00:07:49.134 --> 00:07:51.336
to Israeli Prime Minister
Benjamin Netanyahu

00:07:51.336 --> 00:07:52.571
and told him that the U.S.

00:07:52.571 --> 00:07:55.774
"expected a significant
de-escalation

00:07:55.774 --> 00:07:58.177
and a path to a cease-fire
with Hamas."

00:07:58.177 --> 00:07:59.545
A path?

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:00.879
To a cease-fire?

00:08:00.879 --> 00:08:02.181
You don't need a path.

00:08:02.181 --> 00:08:04.750
Everything you have to do
is in the name.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.218
"Cease-fire."

00:08:06.218 --> 00:08:07.452
What else did he say?

00:08:07.452 --> 00:08:08.754
[ Birds chirping ]
Let's end this thing, Bibi.

00:08:08.754 --> 00:08:11.190
Now, I'm gonna count
to a million.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.659
While discussing the ongoing
criminal investigation

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:16.162
into the Trump organization
in a new interview,

00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:19.298
former President Trump's
ex-personal lawyer Michael Cohen

00:08:19.298 --> 00:08:21.600
said that Trump will
flip on everyone,

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.902
including "his children."

00:08:23.902 --> 00:08:27.873
Said Trump, "Alleged children."

00:08:27.873 --> 00:08:29.709
Microsoft co-founder Bill Gates

00:08:29.709 --> 00:08:32.010
made his first
public appearance yesterday

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:33.512
since his divorce announcement,

00:08:33.512 --> 00:08:35.314
and I don't want to assume
how he's doing,

00:08:35.314 --> 00:08:37.884
but, oh, my God, he got bangs.

00:08:40.219 --> 00:08:42.888
[ Chuckles ]
According to a recent survey,

00:08:42.888 --> 00:08:44.423
nearly 30% of Americans

00:08:44.423 --> 00:08:46.758
are hesitant to invest
in Bitcoin

00:08:46.758 --> 00:08:49.228
because they do not understand
cryptocurrency,

00:08:49.228 --> 00:08:53.832
and another 30% are hesitant
to invest because they do.

00:08:53.832 --> 00:08:56.435
Authorities in the UK
recently arrested two men

00:08:56.435 --> 00:08:59.438
who were allegedly running
a marijuana distribution site

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:01.540
out of an abandoned Bingo hall.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:02.775
Police became suspicious

00:09:02.775 --> 00:09:06.746
when someone under 70 went
into a Bingo hall.

00:09:06.746 --> 00:09:08.313
Drone companies
are reportedly preparing

00:09:08.313 --> 00:09:10.215
to deliver coronavirus vaccines

00:09:10.215 --> 00:09:12.084
to Americans
in rural communities.

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:14.320
Ah, yes -- nothing will increase

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.689
rural Americans' faith
in the vaccines

00:09:16.689 --> 00:09:20.425
like having them delivered
by a corporate drone.

00:09:20.425 --> 00:09:23.662
A new online game has launched
that challenges users

00:09:23.662 --> 00:09:27.099
to try to spend all
of Tesla CEO Elon Musk's

00:09:27.099 --> 00:09:30.502
$166 billion fortune
in 30 seconds.

00:09:30.502 --> 00:09:34.874
"Done!" said someone getting
a six-pack of razors.

00:09:34.874 --> 00:09:37.609
A zoo in Germany
announced yesterday

00:09:37.609 --> 00:09:41.013
that its newest polar bear cub
is the product of breeding

00:09:41.013 --> 00:09:42.548
between two polar bear siblings.

00:09:42.548 --> 00:09:46.752
Wow, they really do treat
their animals like royalty.

00:09:46.752 --> 00:09:49.021
According to a new study,
the average person

00:09:49.021 --> 00:09:52.324
spends around $100 every month
on their pet.

00:09:52.324 --> 00:09:53.892
It's what the cat charges.

00:09:53.892 --> 00:09:57.930
"Look, I'm not gonna walk
over to you for free.

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:00.299
I hate you."

00:10:00.299 --> 00:10:01.900
Authorities
in New Hampshire yesterday

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.236
charged a man
for allegedly detonating

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:07.206
80 pounds of explosives
at a gender reveal party.

00:10:07.206 --> 00:10:11.677
Even scarier, soon he'll be
charged with raising a child.

00:10:11.677 --> 00:10:13.245
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:10:13.245 --> 00:10:15.681
dating apps like Bumble,
Grindr, and Tinder

00:10:15.681 --> 00:10:17.383
are in the top 15%

00:10:17.383 --> 00:10:19.318
of battery-draining apps
on smartphones.

00:10:19.318 --> 00:10:22.054
Even more draining --
the people you meet on them.

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:24.757
And that, you guys,
was the monologue.

00:10:24.757 --> 00:10:28.361 line:0%
♪♪

00:10:28.361 --> 00:10:29.829 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

